{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56579","headline":"九转诗 七 · 窦真君","name":"九转诗 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罢火开丹竃，成金去药泥。\n瑞光连明月，真气杂虹蜺。\n形胜参金鼎，精华向马蹄。\n由须九转毕，看取一刀圭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦真君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}